{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510226","name":"神里绫人【彩蛋】","desc":"神里绫人彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/26d9083149334abe23de0b861e01c572_2930683221230460741.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/d16fbf95d62771daa65ab5d04f6abbd5_3161339584970172839.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e3月26日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e社奉行\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"角色介绍\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e社奉行神里家年轻有为的现任家主，为人温。雅有礼，处事颇有手段。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/dcd86dd959158e44263ba649a6bef4e4_5349345212816280588.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"mcot9s55deT1757446155412\",\"child_ids\":{\"mcot9s55deT1757446155412\":[]},\"contents\":{\"0yx6je48jfjT1762844638844\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：希望能做出漂亮的衣服。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：由你挑的上等布料，自然能做出漂亮衣服。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"1r8w8j1it9aT1762844557516\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：那…我选右边的。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"6yxrdo7nomrT1762844473733\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：让我决定真的好吗…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8xlh5ez2q3T1762844189405\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：绫人？你是来买衣服么？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：旅行者，真是巧遇。之前我在小仓屋预约了一批布料，按照惯例原本是要送到神里屋敷进行挑选的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：只是今日恰好来天守阁与将军大人会谈，所以干脆顺路提前过来看看。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"a6zm703dvttT1762844472899\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：这么重要的事…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"bz9z8zgu8b8T1762844556134\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：那…我选左边的。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"cz2tckbbr6nT1762844637083\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我一定去。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ddcnhtammqrT1762844639925\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：那么，我就先告辞了。下次见，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hpin110j21nT1762844391813\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：呵呵，牵涉社奉行之事从无小事，我已经习惯了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：我已经挑出了两种布料，但又一时决定不了到底选哪一种…旅行者，不如交由你来判断吧。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mcot9s55deT1757446155412\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"oqu2w0w4hjgT1762844223037\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：如果只是寻常用布，那自然是有专人安排。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：但如果是出席正式场合所用的衣物，便要从布料与着色开始考虑，我一般还是会亲自挑选。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：毕竟…神里家为社奉行，负责文化与民生，一举一动也皆会进入稻妻民众的眼中。购入的布匹样式，自然也瞒不过大家。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：每一年采买布匹后，都会有不少商家打着「社奉行曾用此布」的名号来推销布匹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：之前有一年我曾差使家仆采买，但…却有人拿着摩拉去向他贿赂，呵呵，他倒也不推辞…处理这件事时，也算是颇费了一些功夫。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：所以，之后涉及到这类事务时，都是由我来亲自处理，也算是提前免去一些麻烦事。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"pxe1hl32w1iT1762844475298\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：你是我神里府的贵客，更是绫华的知心好友，呵呵，倒不如说没有比你更适合的人选了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：再说了，观你的气质仪态，我也相信你对衣料的品味。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qdppphs8o4T1762844558436\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：嗯，不错。老板，就要这一种布，请包五匹送进府里吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：多谢你了，旅行者，替我解了这踌躇之急。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e神里绫人：我还有些事情要处理，等衣服做好了，还请你来府上做客。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"rjofyt6d6obT1762844221911\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我还以为会让府内人代劳。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"w600tnpo9k9T1762844388934\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：好、好辛苦…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xs78ww2kkfT1762844389782\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：做衣服也这么复杂…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"yey2whkw1gT1762844219474\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：绫人原来会亲自来挑布…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"a42asddcsgT1757446155428\",\"child_ids\":{\"a42asddcsgT1757446155428\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"0b26k37omgdmT1757446155451\",\"child_ids\":{\"0b26k37omgdmT1757446155451\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"sz35eb870uqT1757446155455\",\"child_ids\":{\"sz35eb870uqT1757446155455\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"乍暖…——2026-03-26\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e这几日虽是春来，但依然是乍暖还寒的时节，外出时还是不得不多披一件衣服。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e所幸新衣已经制作完毕，披在身上，日常的风景倒也染上了几分不同的色彩。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e今晨春风又在庭院里催开了几丛花，不妨趁着花开时，来府上赏看一番。府上备了许多厚实的披风，无需忧虑气候。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e若愿在庭院里多坐片刻，还可听你讲讲近来遇见的趣事，想来会增添更多新意。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e茶点已备，随时恭候。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2303\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/9caf1c9d230859fbb031e1a846ad71e2_3368237454404036358.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"绯樱天妇罗\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2303/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2303/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e绯樱天妇罗\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3166\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/d6a00879a4d10275be10c9435794c042_1892300589553195925.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"绯樱虾仙贝\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3166/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3166/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e绯樱虾仙贝\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2417\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/13/24077343/f79807ae020b2224b9e50f769267a8b4_8602034829541932210.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"三彩团子\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2417/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e三彩团子\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53)\\\"\u003e】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/04/50494840/076a91fbc13f6e7d3454c189a383aad0_7649933667866216753.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/04/50494840/076a91fbc13f6e7d3454c189a383aad0_7649933667866216753.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/74178436\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e神里绫人生日快乐 | 这般和煦景致，确实值得好好驻足观赏。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"enqljufpyg6T1757446155433\",\"child_ids\":{\"0hnm592yslmvT1757446261017\":[\"60jm6e0pmzeT1757446320157\",\"hyuj8gxsjyqT1757446321077\"],\"2g9rc599iyxT1757446262002\":[],\"60jm6e0pmzeT1757446320157\":[],\"8fws5azdlbiT1757446500090\":[],\"b22iny500u9T1757446407932\":[],\"cdxjnajkjbT1757446436716\":[\"ftok62g9036T1757446447331\",\"niohdg8b7tlT1757446490499\"],\"dc0u6vgqmf7T1757446374761\":[\"b22iny500u9T1757446407932\"],\"enqljufpyg6T1757446155433\":[\"0hnm592yslmvT1757446261017\",\"zen0gkxtlvaT1757446261339\",\"il41vedkevoT1757446261654\",\"2g9rc599iyxT1757446262002\",\"xpgbtddmapgT1757446263225\"],\"ftok62g9036T1757446447331\":[\"8fws5azdlbiT1757446500090\"],\"hyuj8gxsjyqT1757446321077\":[],\"il41vedkevoT1757446261654\":[\"cdxjnajkjbT1757446436716\"],\"ky492fc6moiT1757446384079\":[\"b22iny500u9T1757446407932\"],\"niohdg8b7tlT1757446490499\":[],\"sr1dnq6khcT1757446352851\":[\"dc0u6vgqmf7T1757446374761\",\"ky492fc6moiT1757446384079\"],\"wxg4o3rgd6cT1757446353777\":[\"dc0u6vgqmf7T1757446374761\",\"ky492fc6moiT1757446384079\"],\"xpgbtddmapgT1757446263225\":[],\"zen0gkxtlvaT1757446261339\":[\"sr1dnq6khcT1757446352851\",\"wxg4o3rgd6cT1757446353777\"]},\"contents\":{\"0hnm592yslmvT1757446261017\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽说摆设我多数见过，但布局却又与我平日里见的不同。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如此巧妙的构思，处处皆有新奇…着实不错。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不如我差人把社奉行府也改成这种风格吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你来当监工，如何？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"2g9rc599iyxT1757446262002\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，绫人。】——【白天】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e一起吃早饭吗？我让家仆们多备了一份。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"60jm6e0pmzeT1757446320157\":{\"option\":\"【该不是说笑的吧…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，被看出来了吗？看来我的演技有所退步啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e话又说回来，这里的确让我很有新鲜感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e就请允许我多来拜访吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8fws5azdlbiT1757446500090\":{\"option\":\"【那就试试吧。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e总之，如果刚开始你有所顾虑的话，我们可以先在这里，权当练习。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e等你也能享受这种乐趣之后，就一起去町街吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e边喝奶茶边遛狗…似乎会引发不小的轰动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵，但也不坏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"b22iny500u9T1757446407932\":{\"option\":\"【真厉害…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e能得到你的赞美和关心，真是不胜荣幸。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e也请你放心吧。现如今，没有人比我更适合社奉行这个位置了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"cdxjnajkjbT1757446436716\":{\"option\":\"【遛…遛狗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，就是陪狗一起散步。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e狗生性忠诚。但就算它们再乖巧，总在一个地方憋着也是会不太愉快的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e和它们一起出门，看它们腾飞四肢，肆意奔跑玩耍的样子，心情也会放松下来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不想试试吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"dc0u6vgqmf7T1757446374761\":{\"option\":\"【不觉得辛苦吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e觉得辛苦，多半是尚未发现自己想守护的东西吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e对于我而言，不会有这种困扰。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"enqljufpyg6T1757446155433\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者，你好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e来得正是时候，这里有一件只有你出面才能处理的任务。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…呵呵，只是想这样说说看。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ftok62g9036T1757446447331\":{\"option\":\"【我有点紧张…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没关系。我会差人准备好性格温顺的狗。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e或者…就请太郎丸出马吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hyuj8gxsjyqT1757446321077\":{\"option\":\"【呃…不太合适吧…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵，怎么露出这么为难的表情呢？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e既然如此，那就不好勉强了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"il41vedkevoT1757446261654\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e旅行者，不知你此前是否遛过狗呢？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ky492fc6moiT1757446384079\":{\"option\":\"【不觉得事情太多吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e工作量庞大吗？也是，但这是无法避免的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那就尽量用聪明些的方法一件件处理吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"niohdg8b7tlT1757446490499\":{\"option\":\"【好呀。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e呵呵，答应得这么干脆么。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"sr1dnq6khcT1757446352851\":{\"option\":\"【关心一下社奉行的工作…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我还以为会让你主动问起的，是更私人的话题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不用担心我在工作上操劳过度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你看，我还有余力像这样说笑呢，呵呵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wxg4o3rgd6cT1757446353777\":{\"option\":\"【关心一下社奉行的生活…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e生活吗…公务之余，能够自由支配的时间确实不多。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e既然你想关心我的生活，不如直接一点，任命你做我的近侍吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e饮食起居，就交给你负责了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊…餐饮方面我没有忌口，生活上的怪癖，嗯…也应该没有。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是有什么口味新奇的东西，可以给我带一份。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xpgbtddmapgT1757446263225\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，绫人。】——【夜晚】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e晚安，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e放心睡吧，不会有人敢来打扰的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/